            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, the dispute centers on whether a collective\u2011bargaining agreement\u2019s arbitration clause precludes individual employees from bringing Age Discrimination in Employment Act (ADEA) claims in court."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f775f4efe490821cd1f67b9dce8431763035cfd7eb774a5b9cd61921eca73984",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f775f4efe490-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter asked whether the union\u2019s arbitration right also includes the right to assert any claim and what the employee\u2019s answer is."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f775f4efe490821cd1f67b9dce8431763035cfd7eb774a5b9cd61921eca73984",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f775f4efe490-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg inquired where the contract addresses the individual\u2019s right to succeed under the union\u2011employer arrangement."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f775f4efe490821cd1f67b9dce8431763035cfd7eb774a5b9cd61921eca73984",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f775f4efe490-0000-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 10,
              "start": 10
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter questioned the source of the language that the union may \u201cturn over\u201d the claim to the employee."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f775f4efe490821cd1f67b9dce8431763035cfd7eb774a5b9cd61921eca73984",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f775f4efe490-0000-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 12,
              "start": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter asked where the guarantee is that if the union declines, the employee has the right either to arbitrate or to sue."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f775f4efe490821cd1f67b9dce8431763035cfd7eb774a5b9cd61921eca73984",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f775f4efe490-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked who would pay for arbitration if the union declines to arbitrate."
      }
    ],
